  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fc68c939cd83f3ace68772760c961d47df5b89d2f8c72c2afc7b1675ab6d508a3%252f68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f6361636865645f696d616765732f633765613561643235646132313034336563386264323166363264353866373539316438306330392e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c68c939cd83f3ace68772760c961d47df5b89d2f8c72c2afc7b1675ab6d508a3/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f6361636865645f696d616765732f633765613561643235646132313034336563386264323166363264353866373539316438306330392e706e67\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"815\" height=\"55\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f301978a37148c75c450301137e1733aac59f8a64cd6c1646901e79fcbab6473b%252f68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f6361636865645f696d616765732f626638336630306631656638626539356135383633346530613265353130663163653337636433392e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/301978a37148c75c450301137e1733aac59f8a64cd6c1646901e79fcbab6473b/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f6361636865645f696d616765732f626638336630306631656638626539356135383633346530613265353130663163653337636433392e706e67\" alt=\"動畫圖片\" width=\"807\" height=\"223\"></a></p><h1>重要事項</h1><p>使用此模組必須安裝<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">playerAnimator</a>和<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>。</p><h1>關於</h1><p>這是一個客戶端模組，為玩家添加酷炫的動畫效果。</p><h1>兼容性</h1><ul>\n<li>可以使用Fresh Animations嗎？\n<ul>\n<li>可以</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>可以使用Eating Animations嗎？\n<ul>\n<li>也可以</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>那Not Enough Animations呢？\n<ul>\n<li>從1.1.1版本開始，動畫應該可以正常運作</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h1>如果想製作自己的動畫怎麼辦？</h1><ul>\n<li>此模組支援與player animator/emotecraft兼容的資源包和動畫</li>\n<li>查看模板資源包<a href=\"https://github.com/McVader34/Serious-Player-Animations-Template-Resource-Pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></li>\n</ul><h1>計劃功能</h1><ul>\n<li>使用不同物品時增加更多動畫</li>\n<li>提升與其他模組的兼容性</li>\n</ul><h1>已知問題</h1><ul>\n<li>與許多模組的自訂動畫不相容</li>\n<li>回報兼容性問題請至<a href=\"https://github.com/McVader34/Serious-Player-Animations/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></li>\n</ul><h2>連結</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/McVader34/Serious-Player-Animations/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/McVader34/Serious-Player-Animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Z6jJFxZAUS\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fserious-player-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serious-player-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
